              "updatedAt": 1792395947739
            },
            {
              "id": "notion_node_2137",
              "text": "2종족. 엄격한 규칙·슬롯파 (PandaDoc, Overleaf, Scrivener)",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "notion_node_2134",
